        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okogwa kwa Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omotienyi o ikomi, omwaka o kianda bw’okogamba gwa Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, amo nabarwani baye bonsi b’esegi, bagacha bakaboera Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ase rituko ria kianda ri’omotienyi o kane bw’omwaka o ikomi nomo, bakabochora chindwaki chi’omochie oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omochie o Yerusalemu obwatetwe, abanene baria bonsi b’oborwoti bwa Babiloni bagasoa ime, bagaikaransa ase Egeita kia Gati‐gati. Abaanene abwo nabwo aba: Nerigali‐Sareseri, na Namigari‐Nebo, na Sari‐Sekemu omoteneneri bw’abasomba b’omorwoti, na Nerigali‐Sareseri, omoringoria omonene amo nabanene bande bonsi b’omorwoti o Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, amo nabarwani baye bonsi, baroche abanene abwo bagatama botuko, bagasoka korwa ase omochie, bagaeta ase omogondo bw’omorwoti, bakagenda bagasokera egeita kiarenge gati‐gati ye chindwaki ibere. Bagatama gochia ase Ekerubo Ekiomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abasikari b’Abakalidayo bakababwatia. Bagaikera Zedekia agwo ase ense eraire ya Yeriko. Ekero bamobwatete, bakamoira ase Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, agwo ase omochie o Ribula, ase ense ya Hamati, na Nebukadinesaro akamonachera ekiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Ribula omorwoti o Babiloni agaita abana abamura ba Zedekia; agaita nabanene bonsi b’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio agakonora Zedekia amaiso, erio akamosiba ne chingataare, akamoira Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Abakalidayo bagasamba enyomba y’omorwoti oyio amo ne chinyomba chi’abaanto, naende bagatagora chindwaki chia Yerusalemu, bagachiiyeria inse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Nebusaradani, omochiki bw’abarendi, akabwata abanto batigarete ase omochie amo na baria batamete gochia asare, akabaira Babiloni ase obosomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omochiki oyio omonene agatigaria abanto bande ase ense y’Abayuda; baria barenge abataka mono, batabwate gento kende, abwo akabaa emegondo y’emesabibu na ase ekero ekio akabaa nemegondo ende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia ogosiborwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, agachiika Nebusaradani, omochiki bw’abarendi, igoro ya Yeremia, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ira Yeremia, omorende buya mono. Tobaisa komokorera amang’ana ande amabe, korende amang’ana aragoteebie omokorere”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Nebusaradani, omochiki bw’abarendi, na Nebusasibani, omoteneneri bw’abasomba b’omorwoti, na Nerigali‐Sareseri, omoringoria omonene, na abanene bonsi abarenge amo nomorwoti o Babiloni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bagatoma abanto barusie Yeremia korwa ase egoora y’abarendi. Abanto abwo bakamobeka ase oborendi bwa Gedalia mosinto bw’Ahikamu, omochokoro o Safani, amoire nka. Bono Yeremia akaba omenyete amo nabaanto bande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosemeria ase Ebedi‐Meleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo ritang’ani, ekero Yeremia agendererete komenya ase egoora eria y’abarendi, ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha asare, rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Genda, oteebie Obedi‐Meleki, Omoetiopia oria, ng’a aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Naama! Amang’ana aane nakwanete igoro ase omochie oyo ninyaikeranie, tari ase okoyorentera amaya, korende ninyorentere obobe. Aye nobeo ase rituko erio orore buna agokoreka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inche Omonene ningotoorie ase rituko erio, gose tokonyara kobekwa ase amaboko ’abaanto abwo aye bwoboete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekeene, inche ningotoorie togoitwa n’omoro. Aye notooreke togoitwa ase esegi, ekiagera aye nigo onsemeretie inche. Nab’Omonene atebiire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
